* EQUATIONS "Check_UnmetHeat"
* 
EQUATIONS 3
T_h_out = max([155,3], HeatDesiredTemp)
mDot_h_out = [155,4]
UnmetHeat = [155,4] * 4.19 * (HeatDesiredTemp - [155,3]) 
*$UNIT_NAME Check_UnmetHeat
*$LAYER Outputs
*$POSITION 291 319
*$UNIT_NUMBER 165

*------------------------------------------------------------------------------


* EQUATIONS "Check_UnmetCool"
* 
EQUATIONS 3
T_f_out = min([158,1], ChilledDesiredTemp)
mDot_f_out = [158,2]
UnmetCool = [158,2] * 4.19 * ([158,1] - ChilledDesiredTemp) 
*$UNIT_NAME Check_UnmetCool
*$LAYER Main
*$POSITION 653 319
*$UNIT_NUMBER 166

