*------------------------------------------------------------------------------

* EQUATIONS "Design-Main"
* 
EQUATIONS 10
mDotHeatMain = (mdotheat1main+mdotheat2main+mdotheat3main+mdotheat4main+mdotheat5main+mdotheat6main)*1.3
mDotColdMain = (mdotcool1main+mdotcool2main+mdotcool3main+mdotcool4main+mdotcool5main+mdotcool6main)*1.4
mDotHeatMainRated = (mdotheat1Rated+mdotheat2Rated+mdotheat3Rated+mdotheat4Rated+mdotheat5Rated+mdotheat6Rated) *1.4
mDotColdMainRated = (mdotcool1Rated+mdotcool2Rated+mdotcool3Rated+mdotcool4Rated+mdotcool5Rated+mdotcool6Rated) *1.5
signalHeat = max(0.1, min(ABS(mDotHeatMain/mDotHeatMainRated), 1))
signalCold = max(0.1, min(ABS(mDotColdMain/mDotColdMainRated), 1))
PPumpMainHeatRated = mDotHeatMainRated * 0.900 !kW/L.s
PPumpMainColdRated = mDotColdMainRated * 0.900 !kW/L.s
AboveHeat = gt(mDotHeatMain, mDotHeatMainRated)
AboveCold = gt(mDotColdMain, mDotColdMainRated)
*$UNIT_NAME Design-Main
*$LAYER Main
*$POSITION 772 226
*$UNIT_NUMBER 132

